Module
  name: game_chaossound
  description: Game sound (O238) - short sounds for your hits, critical hits, kills, damage taken, dodges and blocks, spell casts by element, level up, rare loot, goals and (off by default) windows and buttons; rate limits, a cap on sounds at once, distance fade; follows the client's audio switch and effect volume (System > Sound)
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: true
  scripts: [ soundlogic, chaossound ]
  dependencies:
    - game_interface
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1001
  @onLoad: init()
  @onUnload: terminate()
